<title>USA: Fed Reserve business loans rose in August 6 week.</title>
<headline>Fed Reserve business loans rose in August 6 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED JULY 30</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............824,800 up.....4,600</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......727,900 up.....7,800</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......599,900 up.....1,000</p>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED AUGUST 6</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....874,122 down...1,717</p>
<p> Financial companies.......677,070 down...3,327</p>
<p> New York business loans....47,851 up.......896</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......47,564 up.......888</p>
</text>
